#: includes/class-retreat.php:415
msgid ""
"Hello, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for the letter you wrote to [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] for the retreat \"[retreat_name]\".\n"
"\n"
"In the end, [attendant_name] did not attend the retreat. For confidentiality and data protection reasons, we are going to destroy the digital record of your letter and the printed copy that had been prepared to be delivered.\n"
"\n"
"Your letter is attached to this email, so that you can keep it and use it again if [attendant_name] takes part in a retreat in the coming months.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards."
msgstr ""
"Kaixo, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Eskerrik asko «[retreat_name]» erretirorako [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames](r)i idatzi zenion gutunagatik.\n"
"\n"
"Azkenean, [attendant_name](e)k ez du erretiroan parte hartu. Konfidentzialtasun- eta datuen babeserako arrazoiengatik, zure gutunaren erregistro digitala eta entregatzeko prestatuta zegoen inprimatutako kopia suntsitu egingo ditugu.\n"
"\n"
"Zure gutuna e-posta honi erantsita doa, gorde dezazun eta berriro erabili ahal izan dezazun [attendant_name](e)k datozen hilabeteetan erretiroren batean parte hartzen badu.\n"
"\n"
"Agur bero bat."

